  "reasoning": "The defendant repeatedly solicited large sums of money from multiple individuals by falsely claiming business needs and promising high monthly interest rates, then failed to repay the principal and interest. This conduct constitutes fraudulent fundraising (非法集资) with the purpose of illegal enrichment, which under Chinese criminal law is charged as 集资诈骗罪. No other crimes such as robbery or tax fraud are indicated in the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]集资诈骗罪<eoa>"
